  "summary": "The experiment tested weighted fusion versus concatenation in a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders. Validation accuracy of 0.5399 and F1 of 0.5245 suggest weighted fusion may offer slight improvements over concatenation (config_004). Uncertainty remains about the magnitude of this effect and potential interactions with other model components."
}

